<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-642] Bookie returns incorrect exitcode, ExitCode.ZK_REG_FAIL is getting overridden</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-642</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When bookie registration fails due to zookeeper exception, its not exiting with ExitCode.ZK_REG_FAIL.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Bookie.java&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;try&lt;/span&gt; {
            registerBookie(conf);
        } &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt; (IOException e) {
            LOG.error(&lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;Couldn&apos;t register bookie with zookeeper, shutting down&quot;&lt;/span&gt;, e);
            shutdown(ExitCode.ZK_REG_FAIL);
        }
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
